Version 0.1.1
-------------
    * solc 0.7.6 is pinned for every platform. On darwin_arm64 it is the
      darwin_amd64 binary, run by Rosetta 2, as no arm64 build exists.
    * DefaultEvmVersion: the EVM version a rule compiles for when neither
      it nor its foundry.toml names one. Unset, solc's own default.
    * An unpinned solc version's error lists the pinned ones again.

Version 0.1.0
-------------
    * First release. sol_contract, sol_library, sol_get, sol_test,
      and solc_versions. Forge comes from the foundry plugin. solc
      static binaries are pinned beside it in third_party/binary.
      A failed compile fails the build, and forge test reports
      each revert reason and duration.
